command-description-onfloor = Test or filter if an object is directly on the floor of a grid
command-description-mail-now = Generate a new wave of mail and send out queued mail
command-description-mail-to = Mail items to an entity using the mail system
command-description-mail-contentsTo = Mail items within a container to an entity using the mail system

command-description-npc-setBehavior = set the (HTN) behavior of an entity

command-description-npc-isEnabled = test if the NPC performing actions (HTN)
command-description-npc-setEnabled = enable/disable the NPC taking actions (HTN)

command-description-npc-inCombatMode = test if an entity in combat mode/
command-description-npc-setCombatMode = enable combat mode for an entity

command-description-npc-joinFaction = add an entity to a faction
command-description-npc-leaveFaction = remove an entity from a faction
command-description-npc-leaveAllFactions = remove an entity from all factions
command-description-npc-isFactionMember = test if the entity is part of a faction
command-description-npc-factions = print faction information about an entity
